error: `#[rsjs]` does not recognise event handler attribute `on_mouseenter`. Supported event handler attributes are `on_click`, `on_input`, `on_change`, `on_paste`, `on_focus`, `on_blur`, `on_keydown`, `on_keyup`, `on_mousedown`, `on_mouseup`, `on_mousemove`, `on_mouseover`, `on_mouseout`, `on_scroll`, `on_wheel`, `on_beforeinput`, `on_compositionstart`, `on_compositionupdate`, `on_compositionend`, `on_dragstart`, `on_dragenter`, `on_dragover`, `on_dragleave`, `on_drop`, `on_dragend`, `on_toggle`, `on_beforetoggle`, `on_animationstart`, `on_animationiteration`, `on_animationend`, `on_animationcancel`, `on_transitionrun`, `on_transitionstart`, `on_transitionend`, `on_transitioncancel`, `on_pointerdown`, `on_pointerup`, `on_pointermove`, `on_pointerover`, `on_pointerout`, `on_pointerenter`, `on_pointerleave`, `on_gotpointercapture`, `on_lostpointercapture`, `on_touchstart`, `on_touchmove`, `on_touchend`, `on_touchcancel`, `on_document_click`, `on_document_pointerdown`, `on_document_keydown`, `on_window_popstate`, `on_window_hashchange`, `on_window_storage`, `on_window_resize`, `on_window_scroll`, `on_submit`. Delegated `mouseenter` / `mouseleave` are intentionally not exposed yet; use the bubbling `on_mouseover` / `on_mouseout` events for now.
